      "message": "There are two issues here:\n1. Platforms other than skylake using npcx might not need to trigger a PMIC reset. This was just a workaround for the power topology specifically on skylake platforms derived from glados.\n\n2. On Fizz, since you removed CONFIG_CHIPSET_HAS_PLATFORM_PMIC_RESET, if the board runs into a panic/watchdog reset, then the x86 domain could end up in a weird state since the pmic reset won\u0027t be triggered there.",
